the same origin.\\n\\nThe bar in the corner has three buttons: **←** back to the wall, **🎲** roll\\nanother random game from what the wall was showing, and **✕**. A tap of ✕\\nfolds the bar down to just the ✕ (tap again to bring it back); holding it\\nremoves the bar entirely until the hub is reloaded. The browser's Back button\",\"stderr\":\"\\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174737__x193f88/work\",\"interrupted\":false,\"isImage\":false,\"noOutputExpected\":false,\"bashEditDiff\":{\"files\":[{\"filePath\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174743__x8534bd/agent.out\",\"hunks\":[{\"oldStart\":279,\"oldLines\":3,\"newStart\":279,\"newLines\":4,\"lines\":[\" {\\\"type\\\":\\\"system\\\",\\\"subtype\\\":\\\"thinking_tokens\\\",\\\"estimated_tokens\\\":69,\\\"estimated_tokens_delta\\\":1,\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"6ff8a465-a3dc-4463-ad61-3d7e016e47ef\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"8da4e565-d3f4-4036-a46e-5079b454667e\\\"}\",\" {\\\"type\\\":\\\"system\\\",\\\"subtype\\\":\\\"thinking_tokens\\\",\\\"estimated_tokens\\\":230,\\\"estimated_tokens_delta\\\":161,\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"6ff8a465-a3dc-4463-ad61-3d7e016e47ef\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"91556616-f9d7-458b-b72c-3f527fe4a43d\\\"}\",\" {\\\"type\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"model\\\":\\\"claude-opus-5-5\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_011Cggyjo6MJ6txyWEdgVjpo\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"message\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"thinking\\\",\\\"thinking\\\":\\\"I've got the source's rules (30-second clock, half and full points, double counter points, time-out decisions, senpai practice, bonus stages, and rank tiers), and I'm reading the engine guide's input, attract mode, testing and fighting sections next.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"signature\\\":\\\"\\\"}],\\\"container\\\":null,\\\"stop_reason\\\":null,\\\"stop_sequence\\\":null,\\\"stop_details\\\":null,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input_tokens\\\":2,\\\"cache_creation_input_tok