{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GtdUD1YWvRVxdthaujhkHc","type":"tool_result","content":"275:- `E.Input.halfKeys(preset, side)` †: a preset for half a keyboard ('left' or 'right'): its moves and menu keys, the preset's other actions on its buttons in order, and the preset's gamepad codes (Input.halfKeys(Input.SHMUP, 'right') -> fire on . and Numpad 1, bomb on /)\n468:- `game.addPlayer(o = {})` †: a player in now: { pad: index } (a gamepad) or { keys: 'right' } (the keyboard's right half; player 1 takes the left). Returns its input (null when four play already)\n471:- `game.allowJoin(o = {})` †: let players join, up to max (2..4): Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard (o.keys: false not); onJoin (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) closes it (the names split and join are String's and Array's)\n490:- `game.players` †: the players: [game.input (player 1), ...the ones who joined (game.allowJoin, game.addPlayer: section 10j)]; each an input with player (1..4), name ('P1'), color (E.PLAYER_COLORS) and device. A game of one: [game.input]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ff8a465-a3dc-4463-ad61-3d7e016e47ef","uuid":"13c2d395-05a4-4951-95e7-2364869e70d4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:16:01.034Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"275:- `E.Input.halfKeys(preset, side)` †: a preset for half a keyboard ('left' or 'right'): its moves and menu keys, the preset's other actions on its buttons in order, and the preset's gamepad codes (Input.halfKeys(Input.SHMUP, 'right') -> fire on . and Numpad 1, bomb on /)\n468:- `game.addPlayer(o = {})` †: a player in now: { pad: index } (a gamepad) or { keys: 'right' } (the keyboard's right half; player 1 takes the left). Returns its input (null when four play already)\n471:- `game.allowJoin(o = {})` †: let players join, up to max (2..4): Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard (o.keys: false not); onJoin (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) closes it (the names split and join are String's and Array's)\n490:- `game.players` †: the players: [game.input (player 1), ...the ones who joined (game.allowJoin, game.addPlayer: section 10j)]; each an input with player (1..4), name ('P1'), color (E.PLAYER_COLORS) and device. A game of one: [game.input]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174731__x326e4b/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":1355,"oldLines":3,"newStart":1355,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":4800,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"bbb0a1ea-12f9-46f9-9677-d2d253a967c8\",\"uuid\":\"e8219b49-55f8-4805-af01-414d3024f55a\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":4900,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"bbb0a1ea-12f9-46f9-9677-d2d253a967c8\",\"uuid\":\"6236a6a4-ce43-42ed-bc92-39e7b8099a6a\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":4950,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"bbb0a1ea-12f9-46f9-9677-d2d253a967c8\",\"uuid\":\"04187920-b3bd-459b-92cb-dad3d254642e\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":5100,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"bbb0a1ea-12f9-46f9-9677-d2d253a967c8\",\"uuid\":\"823c6bbb-5e92-4243-ab4e-3f51290ea655\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174740__x7ef5ea/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":1337,"oldLines":3,"newStart":1337,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":14350,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d\",\"uuid\":\"ffa21c48-4e10-4a11-b339-dd20658d2b63\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":14450,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"sess